        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they fought all that day, and when the night came they slept upon their swords.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:20",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "And on the morrow they fought even until the night came.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:21",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And when the night came they were drunken with anger, even as a man who is drunken with wine; and they slept again upon their swords.",
        "footNotes": [
