        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And on the morrow they fought again; and when the night came they had all fallen by the sword save it were fifty and two of the people of Coriantumr, and sixty and nine of the people of Shiz.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
