        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:23",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they slept upon their swords that night, and on the morrow they fought again, and they contended in their might with their swords and with their shields, all that day.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:24",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "And when the night came there were thirty and two of the people of Shiz, and twenty and seven of the people of Coriantumr.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:25",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they ate and slept, and prepared for death on the morrow. And they were large and mighty men as to the strength of men.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:26",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that they fought for the space of three hours, and they fainted with the loss of blood.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:27",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that when the men of Coriantumr had received sufficient strength that they could walk, they were about to flee for their lives; but behold, Shiz arose, and also his men, and he swore in his wrath that he would slay Coriantumr or he would perish by the sword.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Ether 15:28",
        "book": "Ether",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "Wherefore, he did pursue them, and on the morrow he did overtake them; and they fought again with the sword. And it came to pass that when they had all fallen by the sword, save it were Coriantumr and Shiz, behold Shiz had fainted with the loss of blood.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 148,
            "end": 151,
            "text": "Ether 13:21."
          }
